# Prospect lead lists carry contact PII — keep them out of git history
docs/marketing/outreach/leads/
# Same for the telephone call lists (phone numbers + emails) and the rendered
# call-pack email. The README and call-script.md in that folder ARE tracked.
docs/marketing/outreach/telephone/*.csv
docs/marketing/outreach/telephone/*.html
# Generated telephone datasets and personalized call packs can contain contact
# data and bearer report links. Keep only README.md and call-script.md tracked.
docs/marketing/outreach/telephone/*.json
docs/marketing/outreach/telephone/free-fix-pack.md

